OL,3,AOff sick? You need to phone your boss,
OL,4,Aback-to-work adviser says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople off sick from work should keep
OL,7,Fin phone contact with their boss,
OL,8,Fgovernment-appointed back-to-work
OL,9,Fexpert Sir Charlie Mayfield has said.
OL,11,FGetting bosses and workers to have a
OL,12,Fconversation, rather than simply
OL,13,Fexchanging emails and sicknotes, could
OL,14,Fhelp get people back into work, Sir
OL,15,FCharlie, who is leading the Keep
OL,16,FBritain Working taskforce, said.
OL,18,FHis latest report said health-related
OL,19,Feconomic inactivity was costing Britain
OL,20,Faround #212m a year in benefit payments
OL,21,Fand lost output.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
